                        <span class="jl_item_bread">
                                Burj Khalifa: How Many Floors, Height, Cost &#038; Views Guide                            </span>
                            </div>
            <span class="jl_f_cat jl_lb3"><a class="jl_cat_lbl jl_cat2" href="https://illustrarch.com/category/articles"><span>Articles</span></a><a class="jl_cat_lbl jl_cat44796" href="https://illustrarch.com/category/famous-buildings"><span>Famous Buildings</span></a></span>        <h1 class="jl_head_title">
            Burj Khalifa: How Many Floors, Height, Cost &#038; Views Guide        </h1>
                    <p class="post_subtitle_text">Standing at 828 meters with 163 floors, the Burj Khalifa in the United Arab Emirates is the world's tallest building. Explore its Y-shaped structural design inspired by Islamic architecture, the USD 1.5 billion construction story by SOM and Emaar Properties, observation decks on the 124th and 148th floors, luxury Armani Hotel, residential apartments, sustainability features, and what makes this Dubai icon an enduring case study in modern architectural ambition. </p>
                <div class="jl_mt_wrap">
